@model Fanex.Affiliate.Admin.Core.DTO.Email.WithdrawalEmail

<div>
    Dear @Raw(Model.FirstName),<br /><br />

    Congratulation on becoming our @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) affiliate!<br /><br />

    To ensure for a faster payout for your affiliate, please take some time to read the following procedure for withdrawal:<br /><br />

    1. We will settle affiliate's commission payout once in a month, please access your affiliate account and click on Payment request, enter the amount and request Payout.<br /><br />
    2. If your withdrawal request is approved, your fund will be automatically transferred to your @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) betting account.<br /><br />

    Please take note:<br /><br />
    1. Your @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) betting account registered name must be the same registered name that you had registered in your affiliate account, and it must be your real name.<br /><br />

    Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further question.<br /><br />

    Sincerely,<br /><br />
    @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) Affiliates Team<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:@Model.MailContact">@Model.MailContact</a>
</div>